---
<section class="py-32 border-t border-gray-200/50 relative z-10 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full">
  <div class="mb-20 text-left max-w-xl">
    <h2 class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 font-bold text-gray-1000 tracking-tight leading-tight">
      How it works.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-16">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <div class="text-copy-14 font-semibold text-tertiary mb-3">01 / VERIFICATION</div>
      <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Verify Enrolment</h3>
      <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Verify your active student status via email. The system hashes the email for rate-limiting, then discards it immediately.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <div class="text-copy-14 font-semibold text-tertiary mb-3">02 / IDENTITY</div>
      <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Receive a Persona</h3>
      <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Get an anonymous avatar and display name. This remains your persistent identity for chat, forums, and workshops.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <div class="text-copy-14 font-semibold text-tertiary mb-3">03 / CONNECT</div>
      <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Access Support</h3>
      <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Discuss concerns in open forums, message verified upper-class mentors 1-on-1, or sign up for stress-management events.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
